{"s":15,"v":[{"t":"Alif, Lām, Rā. These are the verses of the Book and a clear Qur’ān [i.e., recitation].","w":[["الٓر","Alif Laam Ra","alif-lam-ra","ۚ"],["تِلْكَ","These","til'ka","",[["تِ",279],["لْ",0],["كَ",0]]],["ءَايَـٰتُ","(are) the Verses","āyātu",""],["ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","(of) the Book","l-kitābi","",[["ٱلْ",2],["كِتَـٰبِ",63]]],["وَقُرْءَانٍۢ","and Quran","waqur'ānin","",[["وَ",1],["قُرْءَانٍۢ",186]]],["مُّبِينٍۢ","clear","mubīnin",""]]},{"t":"Perhaps those who disbelieve will wish that they had been Muslims.","w":[["رُّبَمَا","Perhaps","rubamā","",[["رُّبَ",3553],["مَا",0]]],["يَوَدُّ","will wish","yawaddu",""],["ٱلَّذِينَ","those who","alladhīna",""],["كَفَرُوا۟","disbelieved","kafarū","",[["كَفَرُ",53],["وا۟",3]]],["لَوْ","if","law",""],["كَانُوا۟","they had been","kānū","",[["كَانُ",21],["وا۟",3]]],["مُسْلِمِينَ","Muslims","mus'limīna",""]]},{"t":"Let them eat and enjoy themselves and be diverted by [false] hope, for they are going to know.","w":[["ذَرْهُمْ","Leave them","dharhum","",[["ذَرْ",271],["هُمْ",3]]],["يَأْكُلُوا۟","(to) eat","yakulū","",[["يَأْكُلُ",134],["وا۟",3]]],["وَيَتَمَتَّعُوا۟","and enjoy","wayatamattaʿū","",[["وَ",1],["يَتَمَتَّعُ",760],["وا۟",3]]],["وَيُلْهِهِمُ","and diverted them","wayul'hihimu","",[["وَ",1],["يُلْهِ",1461],["هِمُ",3]]],["ٱلْأَمَلُ","the hope","l-amalu","ۖ",[["ٱلْ",2],["أَمَلُ",2153]]],["فَسَوْفَ","then soon","fasawfa","",[["فَ",7],["سَوْفَ",290]]],["يَعْلَمُونَ","they will come to know","yaʿlamūna","",[["يَعْلَمُ",40],["ونَ",3]]]]},{"t":"And We did not destroy any city but that for it was a known decree.","w":[["وَمَآ","And not","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَآ",12]]],["أَهْلَكْنَا","We destroyed","ahlaknā","",[["أَهْلَكْ",239],["نَا",11]]],["مِن","any","min",""],["قَرْيَةٍ","town","qaryatin",""],["إِلَّا","but","illā",""],["وَلَهَا","(there was) for it","walahā","",[["وَ",1],["لَ",8],["هَا",22]]],["كِتَابٌۭ","a decree","kitābun",""],["مَّعْلُومٌۭ","known","maʿlūmun",""]]},{"t":"No nation will precede its term, nor will they remain thereafter.","w":[["مَّا","Not","mā",""],["تَسْبِقُ","(can) advance","tasbiqu",""],["مِنْ","any","min",""],["أُمَّةٍ","nation","ummatin",""],["أَجَلَهَا","its term","ajalahā","",[["أَجَلَ",234],["هَا",22]]],["وَمَا","and not","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَا",12]]],["يَسْتَـْٔخِرُونَ","(can) delay it","yastakhirūna","",[["يَسْتَـْٔخِرُ",1249],["ونَ",3]]]]},{"t":"And they say, \"O you upon whom the message has been sent down, indeed you are mad.","w":[["وَقَالُوا۟","And they say","waqālū","",[["وَ",1],["قَالُ",16],["وا۟",3]]],["يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","O you","yāayyuhā","",[["يَ",42],["ـٰٓأَيُّ",71],["هَا",0]]],["ٱلَّذِى","(to) whom","alladhī",""],["نُزِّلَ","has been sent down","nuzzila",""],["عَلَيْهِ","[on him]","ʿalayhi","",[["عَلَيْ",19],["هِ",5]]],["ٱلذِّكْرُ","the Reminder","l-dhik'ru","",[["ٱل",2],["ذِّكْرُ",132]]],["إِنَّكَ","indeed, you","innaka","",[["إِنَّ",15],["كَ",18]]],["لَمَجْنُونٌۭ","(are) surely mad","lamajnūnun","",[["لَ",23],["مَجْنُونٌۭ",789]]]]},{"t":"Why do you not bring us the angels, if you should be among the truthful?\"","w":[["لَّوْ","Why","law",""],["مَا","not","mā",""],["تَأْتِينَا","you bring to us","tatīnā","",[["تَأْتِي",62],["نَا",11]]],["بِٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةِ","the Angels","bil-malāikati","",[["بِ",10],["ٱلْ",2],["مَلَـٰٓئِكَةِ",143]]],["إِن","if","in",""],["كُنتَ","you are","kunta","",[["كُن",21],["تَ",18]]],["مِنَ","of","mina",""],["ٱلصَّـٰدِقِينَ","the truthful","l-ṣādiqīna","",[["ٱل",2],["صَّـٰدِقِينَ",207]]]]},{"t":"We do not send down the angels except with truth; and they [i.e., the disbelievers] would not then be reprieved.","w":[["مَا","Not","mā",""],["نُنَزِّلُ","We send down","nunazzilu",""],["ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةَ","the Angels","l-malāikata","",[["ٱلْ",2],["مَلَـٰٓئِكَةَ",143]]],["إِلَّا","except","illā",""],["بِٱلْحَقِّ","with the truth","bil-ḥaqi","",[["بِ",10],["ٱلْ",2],["حَقِّ",64]]],["وَمَا","and not","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَا",12]]],["كَانُوٓا۟","they would be","kānū","",[["كَانُ",21],["وٓا۟",3]]],["إِذًۭا","then","idhan",""],["مُّنظَرِينَ","given respite","munẓarīna",""]]},{"t":"Indeed, it is We who sent down the message [i.e., the Qur’ān], and indeed, We will be its guardian.","w":[["إِنَّا","Indeed, We","innā","",[["إِنَّ",15],["ا",11]]],["نَحْنُ","We","naḥnu",""],["نَزَّلْنَا","have sent down","nazzalnā","",[["نَزَّلْ",202],["نَا",11]]],["ٱلذِّكْرَ","the Reminder","l-dhik'ra","",[["ٱل",2],["ذِّكْرَ",132]]],["وَإِنَّا","and indeed, We","wa-innā","",[["وَ",1],["إِنَّ",15],["ا",11]]],["لَهُۥ","of it","lahu","",[["لَ",8],["هُۥ",5]]],["لَحَـٰفِظُونَ","(are) surely Guardians","laḥāfiẓūna","",[["لَ",23],["حَـٰفِظُونَ",677]]]]},{"t":"And We had certainly sent [messengers] before you, [O Muḥammad], among the sects of the former peoples.","w":[["وَلَقَدْ","And certainly","walaqad","",[["وَ",1],["لَ",23],["قَدْ",37]]],["أَرْسَلْنَا","We (had) sent","arsalnā","",[["أَرْسَلْ",106],["نَا",11]]],["مِن","before you","min",""],["قَبْلِكَ","before you","qablika","",[["قَبْلِ",65],["كَ",18]]],["فِى","in","fī",""],["شِيَعِ","the sects","shiyaʿi",""],["ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ","(of) the former (people)","l-awalīna","",[["ٱلْ",2],["أَوَّلِينَ",155]]]]},{"t":"And no messenger would come to them except that they ridiculed him.","w":[["وَمَا","And not","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَا",12]]],["يَأْتِيهِم","came to them","yatīhim","",[["يَأْتِي",62],["هِم",3]]],["مِّن","any","min",""],["رَّسُولٍ","Messenger","rasūlin",""],["إِلَّا","but","illā",""],["كَانُوا۟","they did","kānū","",[["كَانُ",21],["وا۟",3]]],["بِهِۦ","at him","bihi","",[["بِ",10],["هِۦ",5]]],["يَسْتَهْزِءُونَ","mock","yastahziūna","",[["يَسْتَهْزِءُ",485],["ونَ",3]]]]},{"t":"Thus do We insert it [i.e., denial] into the hearts of the criminals.","w":[["كَذَٰلِكَ","Thus","kadhālika","",[["كَ",54],["ذَٰ",32],["لِ",0],["كَ",0]]],["نَسْلُكُهُۥ","We let it enter","naslukuhu","",[["نَسْلُكُ",727],["هُۥ",5]]],["فِى","in","fī",""],["قُلُوبِ","(the) hearts","qulūbi",""],["ٱلْمُجْرِمِينَ","(of) the criminals","l-muj'rimīna","",[["ٱلْ",2],["مُجْرِمِينَ",237]]]]},{"t":"They will not believe in it, while there has already occurred the precedent of the former peoples.","w":[["لَا","Not","lā",""],["يُؤْمِنُونَ","they believe","yu'minūna","",[["يُؤْمِنُ",30],["ونَ",3]]],["بِهِۦ","in it","bihi","ۖ",[["بِ",10],["هِۦ",5]]],["وَقَدْ","and verily","waqad","",[["وَ",1],["قَدْ",37]]],["خَلَتْ","have passed","khalat",""],["سُنَّةُ","the way(s)","sunnatu",""],["ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ","(of) the former (people)","l-awalīna","",[["ٱلْ",2],["أَوَّلِينَ",155]]]]},{"t":"And [even] if We opened to them a gate from the heaven and they continued therein to ascend,","w":[["وَلَوْ","And (even) if","walaw","",[["وَ",1],["لَوْ",73]]],["فَتَحْنَا","We opened","fataḥnā","",[["فَتَحْ",597],["نَا",11]]],["عَلَيْهِم","to them","ʿalayhim","",[["عَلَيْ",19],["هِم",3]]],["بَابًۭا","a gate","bāban",""],["مِّنَ","from","mina",""],["ٱلسَّمَآءِ","the heaven","l-samāi","",[["ٱل",2],["سَّمَآءِ",49]]],["فَظَلُّوا۟","and they were to continue","faẓallū","",[["فَ",7],["ظَلُّ",906],["وا۟",3]]],["فِيهِ","therein","fīhi","",[["فِي",14],["هِ",5]]],["يَعْرُجُونَ","(to) ascend","yaʿrujūna","",[["يَعْرُجُ",1436],["ونَ",3]]]]},{"t":"They would say, \"Our eyes have only been dazzled. Rather, we are a people affected by magic.\"","w":[["لَقَالُوٓا۟","They would surely say","laqālū","",[["لَ",23],["قَالُ",16],["وٓا۟",3]]],["إِنَّمَا","Only","innamā","",[["إِنَّ",15],["مَا",0]]],["سُكِّرَتْ","have been dazzled","sukkirat",""],["أَبْصَـٰرُنَا","our eyes","abṣārunā","",[["أَبْصَـٰرُ",256],["نَا",11]]],["بَلْ","Nay","bal",""],["نَحْنُ","we","naḥnu",""],["قَوْمٌۭ","(are) a people","qawmun",""],["مَّسْحُورُونَ","bewitched","masḥūrūna",""]]},{"t":"And We have placed within the heaven great stars and have beautified it for the observers.","w":[["وَلَقَدْ","And verily","walaqad","",[["وَ",1],["لَ",23],["قَدْ",37]]],["جَعَلْنَا","We have placed","jaʿalnā","",[["جَعَلْ",45],["نَا",11]]],["فِى","in","fī",""],["ٱلسَّمَآءِ","the heavens","l-samāi","",[["ٱل",2],["سَّمَآءِ",49]]],["بُرُوجًۭا","constellations","burūjan",""],["وَزَيَّنَّـٰهَا","and We have beautified it","wazayyannāhā","",[["وَ",1],["زَيَّ",422],["نَّ",11],["ـٰهَا",22]]],["لِلنَّـٰظِرِينَ","for the observers","lilnnāẓirīna","",[["لِ",8],["ل",2],["نَّـٰظِرِينَ",1418]]]]},{"t":"And We have protected it from every devil expelled [from the mercy of Allāh]","w":[["وَحَفِظْنَـٰهَا","And We have protected it","waḥafiẓ'nāhā","",[["وَ",1],["حَفِظْ",1059],["نَ",11],["ـٰهَا",22]]],["مِن","from","min",""],["كُلِّ","every","kulli",""],["شَيْطَـٰنٍۢ","devil","shayṭānin",""],["رَّجِيمٍ","accursed","rajīmin",""]]},{"t":"Except one who steals a hearing and is pursued by a clear burning flame.","w":[["إِلَّا","Except","illā",""],["مَنِ","(one) who","mani",""],["ٱسْتَرَقَ","steals","is'taraqa",""],["ٱلسَّمْعَ","the hearing","l-samʿa","",[["ٱل",2],["سَّمْعَ",475]]],["فَأَتْبَعَهُۥ","then follows him","fa-atbaʿahu","",[["فَ",7],["أَتْبَعَ",609],["هُۥ",5]]],["شِهَابٌۭ","a burning flame","shihābun",""],["مُّبِينٌۭ","clear","mubīnun",""]]},{"t":"And the earth - We have spread it and cast therein firmly set mountains and caused to grow therein [something] of every well-balanced thing.","w":[["وَٱلْأَرْضَ","And the earth","wal-arḍa","",[["وَ",1],["ٱلْ",2],["أَرْضَ",35]]],["مَدَدْنَـٰهَا","We have spread it","madadnāhā","",[["مَدَدْ",692],["نَ",11],["ـٰهَا",22]]],["وَأَلْقَيْنَا","and [We] cast","wa-alqaynā","",[["وَ",1],["أَلْقَيْ",180],["نَا",11]]],["فِيهَا","therein","fīhā","",[["فِي",14],["هَا",22]]],["رَوَٰسِىَ","firm mountains","rawāsiya",""],["وَأَنۢبَتْنَا","and [We] caused to grow","wa-anbatnā","",[["وَ",1],["أَنۢبَتْ",587],["نَا",11]]],["فِيهَا","therein","fīhā","",[["فِي",14],["هَا",22]]],["مِن","of","min",""],["كُلِّ","every","kulli",""],["شَىْءٍۢ","thing","shayin",""],["مَّوْزُونٍۢ","well-balanced","mawzūnin",""]]},{"t":"And We have made for you therein means of living and [for] those for whom you are not providers.","w":[["وَجَعَلْنَا","And We have made","wajaʿalnā","",[["وَ",1],["جَعَلْ",45],["نَا",11]]],["لَكُمْ","